WEBVTT

00:08:30.836 --> 00:08:35.356
Call out inaction,
point to solution, tell the truth.

00:08:35.396 --> 00:08:38.356
Get all that money out of fossil fuels,

00:08:38.396 --> 00:08:40.196
pension investments, accounts,

00:08:40.236 --> 00:08:44.636
hand over power,
make them want to be radical.

00:08:44.676 --> 00:08:46.276
Connect.

00:08:46.316 --> 00:08:48.316
There are people in spaces just like this

00:08:48.356 --> 00:08:51.036
that need to be connected
to grassroots movements,

00:08:51.036 --> 00:08:54.356
who need the attention,
the space, the funding,

00:08:54.396 --> 00:08:57.396
and they need you.

00:08:59.796 --> 00:09:01.076
Ignite.